      "label": "边与连接"
    },
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# CanvasPage 插件\n\n此插件将 [JSON Canvas](https://jsoncanvas.org)（`.canvas`）文件渲染为可交互、可平移和缩放的画布页面。它支持完整的 [JSON Canvas 1.0 规范](https://jsoncanvas.org/spec/1.0/)。\n\n安装：`npx quartz plugin add github:quartz-community/canvas-page`",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-node-demo",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 文本节点\n\n文本节点渲染支持 GFM 的 **Markdown** 内容：\n\n- **粗体**和 *斜体* 文本\n- ~~删除线~~ 文本\n- [外部链接](https://jsoncanvas.org)\n- `行内代码` 块\n- 列表（就像这个）\n\n### 标题也可以\n\n所有标准 Markdown 语法都会在构建时渲染。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "file-node-info",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 文件节点\n\n文件节点引用你仓库中的其他页面。它们显示为可点击链接，并支持悬停时的 **弹出预览**。\n\n下面的节点链接到 CanvasPage 文档：",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "file-node-demo",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "plugins/CanvasPage.md",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "link-node-info",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 链接节点\n\n链接节点引用外部 URL。下面的节点链接到 JSON Canvas 规范：",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "link-node-demo",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "https://jsoncanvas.org/spec/1.0/",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 460,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "color-1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**颜色 1** — 红色",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 830,
      "width": 180,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "color-2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**颜色 2** — 橙色",
      "x": 200,
      "y": 830,
      "width": 180,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "color-3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**颜色 3** — 黄色",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 830,
      "width": 180,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "color-4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**颜色 4** — 绿色",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 830,
      "width": 180,
