      "height": 80,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "color-6",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**颜色 6** — 紫色",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 830,
      "width": 180,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "color-custom",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**自定义十六进制颜色** — `#ff6600`",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 950,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "#ff6600"
    },
    {
      "id": "config-options",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 配置选项\n\n- `enableInteraction` — 启用平移和缩放。默认值：`true`\n- `initialZoom` — 初始缩放级别。默认值：`1`\n- `minZoom` — 最小缩放级别。默认值：`0.1`\n- `maxZoom` — 最大缩放级别。默认值：`5`\n- `defaultFullscreen` — 以全屏模式启动。默认值：`false`\n\n在 `quartz.config.yaml` 中配置：\n\n```\nCanvasPage({ defaultFullscreen: false, initialZoom: 1 })\n```",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1220,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 280
    },
    {
      "id": "config-fullscreen",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 全屏模式\n\n点击 **展开按钮**（右上角）以切换全屏模式。画布会填满整个视口。\n\n- 按 **Escape** 退出全屏\n- 设置 `defaultFullscreen: true` 以全屏启动\n- 切换按钮会在展开和折叠图标之间切换\n\n## Quartz 集成\n\n- **弹出预览**：将鼠标悬停在文件节点上查看预览\n- **内部链接**：文件节点链接到你仓库中的页面\n- **深色模式**：画布会适应你的主题设置",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 1220,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 280
    },
    {
      "id": "edge-source",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 边\n\n边使用 SVG 路径连接节点。它们支持 **标签**、**箭头** 和 **颜色**。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1650,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "edge-labeled",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "这条边有一个 **标签** 和一个箭头标记。",
      "x": 450,
      "y": 1650,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "edge-colored",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "这条边有一个 **自定义颜色**（`#ff6600`）。",
      "x": 450,
      "y": 1780,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "edge-preset",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "边可以使用与节点相同的 **预设颜色**（1–6），或使用自定义 **十六进制颜色**，例如 `#ff6600`。",
      "x": 850,
      "y": 1650,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "api-info",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## API\n\n- **类别**：页面类型\n- **函数名**：`ExternalPlugin.CanvasPage()`\n- **源码**：[quartz-community/canvas-page](https://github.com/quartz-community/canvas-page)\n- **安装**：`npx quartz plugin add github:quartz-community/canvas-page`",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2000,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 180
    },
    {
      "id": "spec-info",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## JSON Canvas 规范\n\n此插件实现了 [JSON Canvas 1.0](https://jsoncanvas.org/spec/1.0/) 规范——一种用于无限画布数据的开放文件格式。\n\nCanvas 文件使用 `.canvas` 扩展名，并且是标准 JSON。它们由 [Obsidian](https://obsidian.md) 原生支持。",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 2000,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 180
    }
  ],
